NOTES
  - You need to install wild-linker using
    $ sudo binstall wild-linker

EXAMPLES
  - Building with LLVM 22.1 (with installation)
    $ ./build.sh --enable-llvm=ON --inkwell-llvm=llvm22-1 --release --install --prefix "/usr/local/"

FEATURES

llvm
  Enables LLVM backend support for code generation.
  Required dependencies:
    - inkwell
    - llvm (system or bundled version compatible with inkwell)

cranelift
  Enables Cranelift backend support for code generation.
  No additional mandatory system dependencies (handled via Cranelift crates).
